WEBVTT

00:00:00.104 --> 00:00:05.746
Entering exam marks

00:00:05.796 --> 00:00:09.075
Open Academics, then Marks Entry.

00:00:11.699 --> 00:00:15.233
Choose the exam, the class and the subject.

00:00:23.519 --> 00:00:26.718
All students of the class load automatically.

00:00:29.794 --> 00:00:34.893
Type each student's marks. The maximum marks are checked for you.

00:00:40.656 --> 00:00:46.180
Press Save All Marks. You can return and edit until results are published.

00:00:49.165 --> 00:00:53.830
Marks are saved
